OL,3,GNEWSAFive injured in 'serious assault'
OL,4,Aon Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been injured in a
OL,7,F"serious assault" on Halloween,
OL,8,Faccording to police.
OL,10,FHampshire Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to Park Road in Chandler's Ford,
OL,12,Fnear Eastleigh, overnight and remain at
OL,13,Fthe scene with a police cordon in
OL,14,Fplace.
OL,16,FIn a statement, the Eastleigh Police
OL,17,Fteam said it recognised the incident
OL,18,Fwould be "concerning for local
OL,19,Fresidents" and it was "actively
OL,20,Finvestigating the circumstances".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
