OL,3,GNEWSAFive injured in 'serious assault'
OL,4,Aon Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eyewitness told the BBC ambulances
OL,7,Fand an air ambulance had attended,
OL,8,Fadding that teenagers at a party in the
OL,9,Farea were heard saying they had been
OL,10,Fstabbed.
